[node name="Text" type="RichTextLabel" parent="Page1/VBoxContainer" unique_id=878142177]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(600, 425)
layout_mode = 2
theme = ExtResource("1_3spy8")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "Build a machine to grow your plant!

You have a hand of cards with useful machine parts. Place them on the grid to build a machine that supports your plant. Every turn, you'll take a limited number of actions to help your plant get resources.

To thrive and grow, a plant needs enough of three resources: [img=5%]res://textures/icon_light.png[/img]light, [img=5%]res://textures/icon_water.png[/img]water and [img=5%]res://textures/icon_nutrients.png[/img] nutrients. If your plant has enough of all three, it will thrive! Once all resources are above the threshold level, the plant will grow onto the trellis.

If any resource runs out, your plant will die! A red resource meter means your plant is in danger.

[center]1/6[/center]"
vertical_alignment = 1

[node name="close_button" type="Button" parent="Page1/VBoxContainer" unique_id=1188268794]
layout_mode = 2
text = "Close"

