theme = ExtResource("1_3spy8")
theme_override_font_sizes/normal_font_size = 18
bbcode_enabled = true
text = "You can also do any of these things without spending an action:

[ul]
Select a card, then click on Recycle a Card to discard a card from your hand
Click Rotate Mode then click on a tile in the machine to rotate a tile that has already been placed
Click on Remove Mode then on a tile to move a tile from the machine into your hand
[/ul]

When you're out of actions, click End Turn. A plant with enough resources will grow! A plant missing resources may wilt.



[center]5/6[/center]"
vertical_alignment = 1

